</span></span><span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.1.1.2.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
<span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text"></span> <span id="S4.T1.1.1.1.1.1.3.2" class="ltx_text">
